Data Segmentation Logic: Upgraded the GET /api/vehicles/{vin}/diagnostics endpoint. Now, when fetching diagnostic data, the API queries SQLite for the most recent repair date. Any raw sensor data (CSV) from before that date is automatically sliced off and ignored.
Streamlit UI Integration: Added a new "Vehicle Maintenance" section to the sidebar in src/gui/streamlit_app.py. You can now type in a repair description and hit "Log Repair & Reset Baseline" directly from the dashboard!
